BT 1 0 0 1 0 12 Tm /F1 8 Tf 10 TL (Chen notation follows the classroom convention: each entity appears once as a rectangle, its non-FK attributes are ovals, and named relationship diamonds connect the actual entities. Identifiers are underlined. The key-only user_farms table is represented by an Assigned to M:N relationship between Users \(farmer accounts\) and Farms. Units, request status history, audit records and responsible-user relationships are included. Dashed red ovals) Tj T* (are derived attributes; blue location ovals combine component attributes. Single and double relationship lines show partial and total participation.) Tj T* ET
